That's something you must find for yourself.

00:12:12.030 --> 00:12:18.960
However, the only thing certain
is that you can see me.

00:12:32.820 --> 00:12:34.810
Sora? Please come for a second.

00:12:38.230 --> 00:12:39.230
Ken...

00:12:39.230 --> 00:12:42.490
This... this is the swing
for the Screw Spin.

00:12:42.630 --> 00:12:43.760
Sora!

00:12:45.100 --> 00:12:48.070
Sorry, but since I put this together so quickly,
it doesn't have enough height, but...

00:12:48.140 --> 00:12:49.500
Yo-ho!

00:12:50.710 --> 00:12:53.040
Go, Sora!

00:12:53.040 --> 00:12:54.600
Don't get beaten by somebody like May.

00:12:55.210 --> 00:12:56.980
Amazing.

00:12:56.980 --> 00:13:00.180
Everyone helped build this
just for you, Sora.

00:13:00.520 --> 00:13:01.950
For me?

00:13:02.280 --> 00:13:07.290
That's right. After all, I still want
you to play Mina Murray.

00:13:07.290 --> 00:13:10.950
It's mortifying if you lose without even
having a chance to practice.

00:13:11.660 --> 00:13:13.890
Mia... Anna...

00:13:14.260 --> 00:13:15.760
Ready?

00:13:15.760 --> 00:13:17.920
Sora is a Kaleido Star!

00:13:20.940 --> 00:13:23.500
So, are you motivated now?

00:13:23.910 --> 00:13:25.070
Yes!

00:13:25.240 --> 00:13:26.710
Thank you, everyone!

00:13:28.840 --> 00:13:30.310
That's Sora for you!

00:13:30.310 --> 00:13:31.900
Always quick to recover.

00:13:33.380 --> 00:13:35.820
It's all thanks to you guys.

00:13:35.820 --> 00:13:37.910
I'll do my best.

00:13:40.450 --> 00:13:43.820
That's right, I don't have time
to doubt myself.

00:13:43.820 --> 00:13:45.190
I just have to do it!

00:13:49.300 --> 00:13:50.530
What's with this swing?!

00:13:54.370 --> 00:13:57.810
Even someone like Sora is having
a hard time to grasp the timing.

00:13:57.810 --> 00:14:00.300
First, she needs to get used to
this special swing.

00:14:01.940 --> 00:14:02.910
Oh, I see.

00:14:03.540 --> 00:14:06.150
This swing turns around easily.

00:14:06.150 --> 00:14:08.710
But once it starts turning, it can't stop.

00:14:08.820 --> 00:14:11.220
It spins too fast.

00:14:11.220 --> 00:14:13.390
I don't know the timing
of when I should jump out.

00:14:13.390 --> 00:14:16.410
But May was able to master it
this far in only one hour. So...

00:14:19.030 --> 00:14:20.800
If I don't work hard now,

00:14:20.800 --> 00:14:22.850
I won't be able to face everyone
who's expecting me to do well.

00:14:24.570 --> 00:14:25.800
Furthermore,

00:14:25.800 --> 00:14:30.200
I'll end up disappointing Miss Layla
who acknowledged me as a partner!

00:14:52.260 --> 00:14:54.730
I'm almost there, but...

00:15:18.220 --> 00:15:20.320
Sora's Sagittarius.

00:15:20.320 --> 00:15:22.380
May's Taurus.

00:15:22.720 --> 00:15:24.860
Leon's Scorpio.

00:15:24.860 --> 00:15:27.460
It is a beautiful balance.

00:15:27.460 --> 00:15:30.690
But if this balance is lost...

00:15:32.070 --> 00:15:35.190
Someone will fall to the ground.

00:15:46.850 --> 00:15:48.310
I did it.

00:15:46.850 --> 00:15:48.310
I did it.

00:15:48.850 --> 00:15:50.420
One more time...

00:15:48.850 --> 00:15:50.420
One more time...

00:15:50.420 --> 00:15:52.280
Until I can do it perfect...

00:15:50.420 --> 00:15:52.280
Until I can do it perfect...

00:16:09.600 --> 00:16:11.270
All right, let's go.

00:16:11.270 --> 00:16:12.870
Wha-

00:16:12.870 --> 00:16:13.930
