00:16:14.410 --> 00:16:18.500
I feel like I have a fever.

00:16:18.580 --> 00:16:19.810
I wonder if it's because of the rain.

00:16:19.810 --> 00:16:21.210
What are you doing to do?

00:16:21.980 --> 00:16:23.720
What I am going to do?

00:16:23.720 --> 00:16:26.190
I just have to do it.
I have to! I have to!

00:16:43.470 --> 00:16:46.670
All right, we're going to start testing now.

00:16:46.670 --> 00:16:48.210
First, Sora.

00:16:48.210 --> 00:16:49.180
Yes.

00:16:52.280 --> 00:16:53.550
Oh, no.

00:16:53.550 --> 00:16:57.520
My body feels heavy. I've got chills.

00:16:57.520 --> 00:17:01.920
Anyhow, I have to give my best shot.
I have to! I have to!

00:17:16.600 --> 00:17:18.730
What?

00:17:19.970 --> 00:17:24.670
Oh, no... I'm getting dizzy.

00:17:46.370 --> 00:17:47.560
I won!

00:17:49.240 --> 00:17:52.270
As I thought, that's all you've got!

00:17:52.270 --> 00:17:56.040
You were not supposed to be
Miss Layla's partner.

00:17:56.440 --> 00:18:01.110
Now I'll show you how a real
Kaleido Star performs.

00:18:22.070 --> 00:18:23.200
Beautiful...

00:18:36.150 --> 00:18:38.890
