00:18:38.890 --> 00:18:42.090
How was my performance?

00:18:42.090 --> 00:18:44.060
I passed, right?

00:18:45.860 --> 00:18:47.050
It's not even worth discussing.

00:18:49.600 --> 00:18:53.060
Why?! I didn't make a mistake!

00:18:53.500 --> 00:18:56.540
I practiced so hard!

00:18:56.540 --> 00:18:58.910
My performance was better than Sora's!

00:18:58.910 --> 00:19:00.340
I don't understand!

00:19:09.750 --> 00:19:11.090
Mr. Leon.

00:19:11.090 --> 00:19:14.610
He never practiced the Screw Spin...

00:19:15.260 --> 00:19:19.120
I wonder if he can do a proper
performance without practice.

00:19:42.380 --> 00:19:43.650
Amazing...

00:19:49.990 --> 00:19:53.360
