00:20:21.420 --> 00:20:23.010
Oh... Nothing like that.

00:20:26.990 --> 00:20:29.430
Rewrite the script for Dracula.

00:20:29.430 --> 00:20:31.020
I will be the only star in the show.

00:20:31.400 --> 00:20:34.200
Mr. Leon, Sora has a fever.

00:20:34.340 --> 00:20:35.870
She practiced in the rain yesterday.

00:20:34.340 --> 00:20:35.870
That has nothing to do with this.

00:20:35.870 --> 00:20:37.040
She practiced in the rain yesterday.

