It's not because of my temperature.

00:20:38.670 --> 00:20:39.510
Please give her one more chance.

00:20:39.510 --> 00:20:40.640
Please.

00:20:39.510 --> 00:20:40.640
Everyone, really, you don't need to...

00:20:40.640 --> 00:20:41.670
